MPEG4HighProfileLevel4_2_For3DVideoTransferSyntax    1\&.2\&.840\&.10008\&.1\&.2\&.4\&.105
MPEG4StereoHighProfileLevel4_2TransferSyntax         1\&.2\&.840\&.10008\&.1\&.2\&.4\&.106
